  "description": "Despite possessing great beauty and wealth, Anastasia Sinclair suffers in pain due to a terminal illness. With just two years to live, her only wish is to enjoy life, especially with her friend, the handsome and kind Adele Magnus. As they grow closer, she realizes she has feelings for him, but having read this story in her past life, Anastasia knows that Adele actually meets the love of his life… at her funeral! Will this ailing lady's off-script crush corrupt the male lead’s fairy-tale ending? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
